Battleship Game Project
Introduction
The Battleship Game Project is an implementation of the classic Battleship game in Python. The project includes components such as game logic, player interface, and AI opponent.

Prerequisites
Python 3.x
Flask

Installation
To install the required dependencies, run the following command:
pip install Flask

Getting started tutorial: 
1.Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/your-username/battleship-game.git
cd battleship-game

2. Install dependencies:
3.Run the Battleship Game on main.py
Download the "tests" folder
Software can be tested by running thefollowing modules found in the "tests" folder:
__init__.py
test_functionality.py
test_helperfunctions.py
test_students

